{"ID":"20240205153716-v5l5j0n","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153716-v5l5j0n","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153716-v5l5j0n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205162539-aqw27u4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614110735-449cp8j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2058,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614111103-ur4br5t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:9,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:9\u0026#125;","title":"366补09柏叶（侧柏叶）","type":"doc","updated":"20240828141843"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206114821-yt9i02a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206114821-yt9i02a","updated":"20240206114824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t全国大部地区均产。\n【性状】\t多有分支，小且长短不一，为鳞片状。颜色为红褐色。表面可见叶相互对生，断面黄白色。质地松脆、易被折断。茎枝类圆柱形，红棕色；小枝扁平，直径1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2mm。叶细小鳞片状，交互对生，贴伏于枝上，深绿色或黄绿色。质脆。气清香，味苦涩、微辛。\n【性味】\t苦、涩，寒。\n【功效】\t凉血，止血，祛风湿，散肿毒。治吐血、衄血、尿血、血痢、肠风、崩漏，风湿痹痛，细菌性痢疾，高血压，咳嗽，丹毒，痄腮，烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240206114816-4trvxuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206114816-4trvxuu","updated":"20240206114816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206114816-sljoeox.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205164430-g4a9ty0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205164430-g4a9ty0"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"侧柏叶"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/侧柏叶-20240205162539-ay7q9in.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240704122839-3mf0k7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240704122839-3mf0k7r","updated":"20240704124524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"侧柏2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/侧柏2-20240704122839-8w7aoc5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 449px;","style":"width: 439px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221192740-9gzlrbd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 439px;\" parent-style=\"width: 449px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828141843-06pi017","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828141843-06pi017","updated":"20240828141843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 375px;","style":"width: 365px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"侧柏 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/侧柏 4-20240828141444-gvixiw6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 365px;\" parent-style=\"width: 375px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 831px;","style":"width: 821px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"侧柏 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/侧柏 5-2